.TH XWP 1 "@@@DATE@@@" "@@@VERSION@@@" "WordProcess"
.SH NAME
xwp \- graphical WordProcess frontend
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xwp
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file.wp ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xwp
provides the GLFW/OpenGL frontend for WordProcess. It uses the same native .wp
document format, settings, editing engine, and command-line options as the
console frontend.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B xwp \-\-help
for the available command-line options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.wordprocess/startup.lua
Optional per-user startup script.
.SH AUTHORS
WordProcess changes are maintained by Leandro V. Catarin. WordProcess is a
fork of WordGrinder; thanks to David Given for the original work.
